### Changes implemented:

**`src/auth.py`**
- `has_permission`: Changed to case-insensitive comparison using `any()` and `.lower()`.
- `is_admin_or_owner`: Changed logic from `AND` to `OR` to correctly grant access if the user is either an admin or the owner.

**`src/inventory.py`**
- `__init__`: Fixed shared state bug by removing the mutable default argument `{}` and initializing `_stock` as a new dictionary.
- `add`: Changed from overwriting to accumulating stock values.
- `reserve`: Changed boundary check from `>=` to `>` to allow reserving exactly the amount of available stock.
- `release`: Added a check to raise `ValueError` if releasing more than the current reservation, preventing negative reservation counts.

**`src/text_utils.py`**
- `slugify`: Added `.lower()` to the result and implemented `re.sub` to collapse all repeated separators (`--`, `---`, etc.) into a single hyphen.
- `truncate`: Adjusted slicing to `max_len - len(suffix)` to ensure the final string length (including suffix) does not exceed `max_len`.

